Your tongue turns into a diseased tentacle that you use to ''lick'' enemies in a cone.

Licked creatures take 100% tentacle damage that ignores armor and get sick, gaining a random disease for 6 turns that deals [22, 28, 32, 36, 39 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage per turn and reduces strength, dexterity or constitution by [15, 21, 25, 28, 31 (TL1-5; SP 100)].

If at least one enemy is hit you gain 10 insanity.

Disease damage will increase with your Spellpower.
